# LLM-IQ-Data Licensing (双轨开源许可声明)

This repository follows a dual-licensing scheme to ensure open collaboration and unambiguous rights for both code tools and benchmark datasets:

## 1. Code, Tooling & Scripts
All code, scripts, synchronization hooks, and validation utilities located in this repository are licensed under the **MIT License**.
* License Text: [LICENSE-CODE](LICENSE-CODE)
* Scope: Code and software components.

## 2. Benchmark Datasets, Output Metadata & SVG Works
All evaluation datasets, benchmark results (`run.json`), aggregations (`index.json`), and generated SVG artwork (`*.svg`) hosted in this repository are licensed under the **Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License (CC-BY 4.0)**.
* License Text: [LICENSE-DATA](LICENSE-DATA)
* Summary: You are free to share (copy and redistribute) and adapt (remix, transform, and build upon) the material for any purpose, even commercially, under the condition that you provide appropriate attribution.
* Attribution format:
  > Benchmark data sourced from LLM-IQ Dashboard & Benchmark (https://github.com/meomeo-dev/llm-iq-data) by xumetide-dev.
